{"schema_version":1,"paper_id":"zj-26-erkao--zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602","questions":[{"id":"zj-26-erkao--zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602-q01","paper_id":"zj-26-erkao--zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602","source_question_id":"zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602-q01","number":"1","order":1,"type":"单选题","topics":["电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"a676becbc3d650e2e819cfc97d07893a10669c9cd7992d11bfdaff957ac8e46b","body":[{"type":"text","value":"1. 磁感应强度B也叫磁通密度，其大小可以用磁感线的疏密表示，下列B的单位正确的是\n\n原卷公共参数：可能用到的相关参数:重力加速度g取 "},{"type":"math","value":"1 0 \\mathrm { m } / \\mathrm { s } ^ { 2 }"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm { T } \\cdot \\mathrm { m } ^ { 2 }"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm { T / m ^ { 2 } }"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm { W b } \\cdot \\mathrm { m } ^ { 2 }"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm { W b } / \\mathrm { m } ^ { 2 }"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"D","body":[{"type":"text","value":"由"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Phi=BS"},{"type":"text","value":"得"},{"type":"math","value":"B=\\frac{\\Phi}{S}"},{"type":"text","value":"，磁通量"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Phi"},{"type":"text","value":"的单位为 Wb，所以磁场感应强度的单位也可以表示为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{Wb/m^2}"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-erkao--zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602-q02","paper_id":"zj-26-erkao--zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602","source_question_id":"zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602-q02","number":"2","order":2,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"6657d31a566dfacaed41a55d9d195ce110f4ab3599145145be43af724b0fe4f7","body":[{"type":"text","value":"2.2025年9月25日，歼-35在福建舰完成起降训练的画面被公开。如图所示为歼-35舰载战斗机在福建舰电磁弹射起飞。关于歼-35\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/9e4039a45d93863c2801fb156958a96a06b865973d516c480f6a580fa51b9eb3.png","width":333,"height":231,"width_mm":39.06,"row_group":"zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602-q02-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n\n原卷公共参数：可能用到的相关参数:重力加速度g取 "},{"type":"math","value":"1 0 \\mathrm { m } / \\mathrm { s } ^ { 2 }"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n第 2 题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A.研究电磁弹射起飞推力的作用点时，可将歼-35视为质点"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B.加速飞行时，空气对歼-35的作用力大于歼-35对空气的作用力"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C.匀速爬升时，歼-35的机械能增大"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D.在航母甲板上减速时，歼-35对飞行员的作用力小于飞行员的重力"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"C","body":[{"type":"text","value":"歼-35 起飞时既有电磁弹射的推力，又有发动机的推力，推力的作用效果与战斗机的结构有关，所以此时不能把歼-35 视为质点，A 错。加速飞行时，空气对歼-35 的作用力与歼-35 对空气的作用力是作用力与反作用力，大小相等，所以 B 错。歼-35 匀速爬升时，动能不变，重力势能增大，所以机械能增大，C 正确。在航母甲板上减速时，歼-35 对飞行员的作用力大于重力，D 错。故选 C。"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-erkao--zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602-q03","paper_id":"zj-26-erkao--zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602","source_question_id":"zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602-q03","number":"3","order":3,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学","电学","近代物理"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"e42d1457393cfb565e1d34226bd0450f3a00194aa2344d9b412aabf98b5379b0","body":[{"type":"text","value":"3.在"},{"type":"math","value":"\\alpha"},{"type":"text","value":"粒子散射实验中，假设所有"},{"type":"math","value":"\\alpha"},{"type":"text","value":"粒子初速度都相同，当"},{"type":"math","value":"\\alpha"},{"type":"text","value":"粒子靠近静止的金原子核，它们发生了不同角度的偏转，如图所示。图中虚线是以金原子核为圆心的圆，轨迹2中的P点离金原子核最近，不考虑"},{"type":"math","value":"\\alpha"},{"type":"text","value":"粒子间的相互作用。则在与金原子核相互作用过程中，沿轨迹2运动的"},{"type":"math","value":"\\alpha"},{"type":"text","value":"粒子\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/bb8c9cb6247e3078afc4f2c4ccecf4844f8fd4984a57de0c2bf8763866439231.png","width":356,"height":312,"width_mm":41.79,"row_group":"zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602-q03-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n\n原卷公共参数：可能用到的相关参数:重力加速度g取 "},{"type":"math","value":"1 0 \\mathrm { m } / \\mathrm { s } ^ { 2 }"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n第3题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 与沿轨迹1运动的"},{"type":"math","value":"\\alpha"},{"type":"text","value":"粒子相比，动量变化大"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 与沿轨迹1运动的"},{"type":"math","value":"\\alpha"},{"type":"text","value":"粒子相比，散射后获得的动能大"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C.与图中其它的"},{"type":"math","value":"\\alpha"},{"type":"text","value":"粒子相比，经过虚线位置时动能较大"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D.经过P点时电势能最小，且速度方向与库仑力方向垂直"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"A","body":[{"type":"text","value":"α 粒子与静止的原子核相互排斥，靠近时库仑力做负功，远离时电场力做正功，散射前后库仑力总功为 0，α 粒子的动能不变，速度大小相等，因沿轨迹 2 运动的 α 粒子与 1 比，经散射后偏转的角度较大，所以速度变化量较大，即动量变化大，故 A 对 B 错。虚线是一条等势线，不同的 α 粒子经过虚线时的电势能相等，因为 α 粒子的初动能都相等，所以经过虚线位置时的动能也相等，C 错。经过 P 点时 α 粒子的电势能最大，动能最小，力与速度垂直，所以 D 错。故选 A。"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-erkao--zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602-q04","paper_id":"zj-26-erkao--zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602","source_question_id":"zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602-q04","number":"4","order":4,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"e27bec7c5725d4135e82c5ad3908393835a4e4c9566fc293316eb68298f19ef3","body":[{"type":"text","value":"4.一质量为m的物体C用轻弹簧悬挂，悬点为O，此时轻弹簧的长度为L；现对A点施加一始终垂直弹簧轴线方向的作用力F，缓慢拉至OA与竖直方向的夹角为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":"时\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/ef87f990cc45641164bd876d83f16c2a8a9711ad10e5bd4a2970c5e281b6c742.png","width":222,"height":276,"width_mm":26.04,"row_group":"zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602-q04-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第4题图\n\n原卷公共参数：可能用到的相关参数:重力加速度g取 "},{"type":"math","value":"1 0 \\mathrm { m } / \\mathrm { s } ^ { 2 }"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 弹簧长度保持不变"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 作用力F不断增大"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 弹簧的弹性势能先增大后减小"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 拉力做的功等于物体C 增加的机械能"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"B","body":[{"type":"text","value":"对 A 点受力分析，可得弹力与拉力的合力等于重力，在缓慢拉动的过程中，弹力减小，拉力增大，所以弹簧的长度减小，弹性势能减小，故 AC 错，B 对。又因为弹力也做了功，所以拉力做的功小于物体 C 增加的机械能，D 错。故选 B。"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-erkao--zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602-q05","paper_id":"zj-26-erkao--zhennan-qicai-ji