"status":"source","key":"A","body":[{"type":"text","value":"由"},{"type":"math","value":"a=\\frac{GM}{R^2}"},{"type":"text","value":"得航天器的加速度与航天器到月球的距离的平方成反比，所以航天器乙在 Q 点时到月球的距离是甲的"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac32"},{"type":"text","value":"倍，所以加速度甲的"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac49"},{"type":"text","value":"倍，A 对 B 错。由开普勒第二定律可得，航天器乙在 P 点时的速度是在 Q 点时的 3 倍，C 错。航天器乙和甲周期相同，椭圆的长轴与圆的直径相等时，其面积小于圆面积，所以航天器乙与月球的连线在相同的时间内扫过的面积小于甲，D 错。"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-erkao--zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602-q07","paper_id":"zj-26-erkao--zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602","source_question_id":"zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602-q07","number":"7","order":7,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学","电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"e1b7472449bb4c56f4a3c2b7d21602c55393e86b25297e8a5e1ffedf3fe35e31","body":[{"type":"text","value":"7.如图所示，在一场人形机器人跑步大赛中，某型号机器人在平直路面上以速度"},{"type":"math","value":"v"},{"type":"text","value":"匀速跑步，此时电池工作电压为U，输出电流为I，已知输出功率的80%用于电机驱动，驱动电机的输出能量转化为机器人跑步的机械能的效率为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\eta"},{"type":"text","value":"，机器人跑步时受到的阻力为f，则\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/a3d91c270e456da800c137df621fbda5c81b4f06e150a3fb9b5d66ff1e2e7a23.png","width":298,"height":291,"width_mm":34.86,"row_group":"zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602-q07-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n\n原卷公共参数：可能用到的相关参数:重力加速度g取 "},{"type":"math","value":"1 0 \\mathrm { m } / \\mathrm { s } ^ { 2 }"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n第7题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 驱动电机的输出功率为0.8UI"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 驱动电机线圈的电阻为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{0.8\\eta UI - fv}{0.64\\eta I^{2}}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 驱动电机的效率为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac { f v } { 0 . 8 U I }"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 机器人克服阻力做功的功率为0.8"},{"type":"math","value":"\\eta"},{"type":"text","value":"UI"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"B","body":[{"type":"text","value":"解题约定：电机端电压等于电池工作电压"},{"type":"math","value":"U"},{"type":"text","value":"，因此电机输入电流为"},{"type":"math","value":"0.8UI/U=0.8I"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"type":"text","value":"\n由题意得，驱动电机的输入功率为"},{"type":"math","value":"0.8UI"},{"type":"text","value":"，A 错。机器人克服阻力做功的功率为"},{"type":"math","value":"fv"},{"type":"text","value":"，驱动电机的输出功率为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{fv}{\\eta}"},{"type":"text","value":"，所以驱动电机的电热功率为"},{"type":"math","value":"P_{\\text{热}}=0.8UI-\\frac{fv}{\\eta}"},{"type":"text","value":"，又"},{"type":"math","value":"P_{\\text{热}}=0.64I^2R"},{"type":"text","value":"，所以"},{"type":"math","value":"R=\\frac{0.8\\eta UI-fv}{0.64\\eta I^2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，驱动电机的效率为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{fv}{0.8\\eta UI}"},{"type":"text","value":"，CD 错，B 正确。故选 B。"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-erkao--zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602-q08","paper_id":"zj-26-erkao--zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602","source_question_id":"zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602-q08","number":"8","order":8,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"e7dd18685dea5184835397fcb8510239c84225b0c6274ed7831152944e5d8b66","body":[{"type":"text","value":"8.某同学在对竖直墙练习网球时，球竖直落到地面弹起到最高点时把球击出，两次击球点的位置与球飞出的方向均相同，第一次球恰好水平击中墙面，第二次击中墙面的位置与击球点高度相同，"},{"type":"text","value":"如图所示。设第一次击出球的速度大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"v _ { 1 }"},{"type":"text","value":" ，球的运动时间为 "},{"type":"math","value":"t _ { 1 }"},{"type":"text","value":" ，第二次击出球的速度大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"v _ { 2 }"},{"type":"text","value":" ，球的运动时间为 "},{"type":"math","value":"t _ { 2 }"},{"type":"text","value":" ，空气阻力忽略不计。则\n\n原卷公共参数：可能用到的相关参数:重力加速度g取 "},{"type":"math","value":"1 0 \\mathrm { m } / \\mathrm { s } ^ { 2 }"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/b1a833abda8ec5b90ac62248e4851a107b3932a95106772a1f9699a2378eecc5.png","width":296,"height":175,"width_mm":34.65,"row_group":"zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602-q08-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n\n第8题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}=2v_{2},\\ t_{2}=2t_{1}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{2}=2v_{1},\\ t_{1}=2t_{2}"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 两次击球时对球做功之比为2:1"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 两次击球后，球在空中飞行过程中动量变化量为1:2"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"C","body":[{"type":"text","value":"解：设击球点到墙的水平距离为"},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":"，球飞出的方向与水平方向成"},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":"角，则"},{"type":"math","value":"t_1=\\frac{v_1\\sin\\theta}{g}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"t_2=\\frac{2v_2\\sin\\theta}{g}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"x=v_1\\cos\\theta\\frac{v_1\\sin\\theta}{g}"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"x=v_2\\cos\\theta\\frac{2v_2\\sin\\theta}{g}"},{"type":"text","value":"，得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_1=\\sqrt2 v_2"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"type":"math","value":"t_2=\\sqrt2 t_1"},{"type":"text","value":"，A、B 错。击球时对球所做的功等于球的动能，因为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_1=\\sqrt2v_2"},{"type":"text","value":"，所以"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{k1}=2E_{k2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，C 正确。球飞行过程中只受重力作用，球的动量变化量等于重力的冲量，而冲量与时间成正比，所以冲量之比为"},{"type":"math","value":"1:\\sqrt2"},{"type":"text","value":"，D 错。故选 C。"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-erkao--zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602-q09","paper_id":"zj-26-erkao--zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602","source_question_id":"zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602-q09","number":"9","order":9,"type":"单选题","topics":["电学","光学","近代物理"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"2dd7207ccd2c4948a8c99f8851434d67a60b652a07ba31d29bb610c8c1c5661f","body":[{"type":"text","value":"9.光控继电器是一种利用光信号控制电路通断的半导体器件，其工作原理如图所示。它由电源、光电管、放大器、电磁继电器等组成。当光照强度达到一定值时，形成的光电流被放大器放大后，电磁铁产生足够强的磁场吸引衔铁，从而达到控制电路通断的目的。已知“硬磁材料”一经磁化即能保持恒定磁性，而“软磁材料”则易于磁化，也易于退磁。对于这一控制电路，下列说法正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/ff96962b961e2e03f4894e0a125cdcfdd5c528481036b1cdb73af5299bc01f0f.png","width":546,"height":239,"width_mm":64.05,"row_group":"zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602-q09-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第9题图\n\n原卷公共参数：可能用到的相关参数:重力加速度g取 "},{"type":"math","value":"1 0 \\mathrm { m } / \\mathrm { s } ^ { 2 }"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 放大器左边的电路电流方向沿顺时针"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 光控继电器的电磁铁的铁芯应采用“硬磁材料”"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 如果蓝光能使该继电器工作，那么黄光也一定能使其工作"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 用该光控继电器控制路灯工作时，白天电磁铁吸住衔铁接通电路"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"A","body":[{"type":"text","value":"解：当光电管工作时，光照阴极 K 打出的电子向阳极运动形成光电流，电流方向与电子运动方向相反，所以放大器左边的电路电流方向沿顺时针，A 正确。电磁铁通过电流控制磁场变化，铁芯应采用“软磁材料”，B 错。黄光频率比蓝光低，蓝光能照射时光电管阴极是能发生光电效应，改用黄光照射时就不一定能发生光电效应，所以 C 错。用路灯白天断开，晚上工作时，所以控制器白天电磁铁吸住衔铁时应断开电路，D 错。故选 A。"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-erkao--zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602-q10","paper_id":"zj-26-erkao--zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602","source_question_id":"zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602-q10","number":"10","order":10,"type":"单选题","topics":["力学","光学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"6fd796663ab062374c24b69d9dfedbf652dc2d4da25c3f446025d2fb71133bde","body":[{"type":"text","value":"10.如图甲所示，实验中水波从深水区A传向浅水区B，沿垂直波面（振动相同的点构成的面）方向画出波线（波的传播方向）得水波在深浅水分界线上的入射角为 "},{"type":"math","value":"5 3 ^ { \\circ }"},{"type":"text","value":" ，折射角为 "},{"type":"math","value":"3 7 ^ { \\circ }"},{"type":"text","value":" ，已知水波的折射原理与光的折射原理相同（在光的折射中，某种介质的折射率等于光在真空中的传播速度c与光在这种介质中的传播速度"},{"type":"math","value":"v"},{"type":"text","value":"之比）。 "},{"type":"math","value":"S _ { 1 }"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"S _ { 2 }"},{"type":"text","value":" 是x轴上的两个完全相同的波源，它们到原点O的距离相等，质点P在y轴上，Q点位于第一象限，如图乙所示。 "},{"type":"math","value":"S _ { 1 }"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"S _ { 2 }"},{"type":"text","value":" 、P、Q都在A区时，Q是振动极弱点，且PQ连线上还有3个振动极弱点。则\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/bbf3df493e1725415bf0faa0da41c1ae15b4d452d3f4e37066218a6c505eefb9.png","width":188,"height":216,"width_mm":22.05,"row_group":"zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602-q10-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/126e59ce001f087063dc974c196bc8eab893c4022b3f405261a8b2b214e402fe.png","widt