pics":["电学","热学","近代物理"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"d0aed7506035626d00e3b0be03198eb3a74edae88438eeef23e42f0e6c952093","body":[{"type":"text","value":"11. 下列判断正确的是\n\n原卷公共参数：可能用到的相关参数:重力加速度g取 "},{"type":"math","value":"1 0 \\mathrm { m } / \\mathrm { s } ^ { 2 }"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 比结合能越大的原子核越稳定"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 放射性元素经过4个半衰期还剩 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{4}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的元素没有发生衰变"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 红外线和X射线都是电磁波，在真空中传播的速度相等"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 一个系统把所吸收的热量全部用来对外做功是不可能的"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"AC","body":[{"type":"text","value":"解：比结合能越大，即核子结合成原子核时平均每个核子释放的能量越多，原子核结合越牢固，A 正确。放射性元素经过 4 个半衰期还剩"},{"type":"math","value":"(\\frac12)^4"},{"type":"text","value":"的元素没有发生衰变，B 错。红外线和 X 射线都是电磁波，在真空中传播的速度相等，C 正确。在气体等温膨胀时，所吸收的热量全部用来对外做功，D 错。故选 AC。"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-erkao--zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602-q12","paper_id":"zj-26-erkao--zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602","source_question_id":"zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602-q12","number":"12","order":12,"type":"多选题","topics":["光学","近代物理"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"5b1b4db1ce6a914d7d56657e1066f8b5039365090acabb2e8f5b54464a964110","body":[{"type":"text","value":"12. 氢光谱中有4条可见光光谱，如图甲所示，对其发出的 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm { H } _ { \\gamma }"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm { H _ { \\beta } }"},{"type":"text","value":" 两种光，下列说法正确的是\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/5e4273bf2af4dcd30129791979b2bb45043246a314c93ff533cb85ce908a169f.png","width":344,"height":127,"width_mm":40.32,"row_group":"zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602-q12-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n甲: 氢光谱的谱线\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/eb7ff77d2a123f4f75174c43718044fe6071263b2fc6e96a2806f6a965546a72.png","width":237,"height":147,"width_mm":27.72,"row_group":"zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602-q12-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n乙: 光的折射\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/4