"type":"text","value":"，B 错。在劈尖干涉中，条纹间距与波长成正比，所以"},{"type":"math","value":"H_\\gamma"},{"type":"text","value":"在图丙实验中的条纹间距换成"},{"type":"math","value":"H_\\beta"},{"type":"text","value":"后将变大，C 正确。在圆孔衍射时，波长越短，中央亮斑的直径越小，所以 D 正确。故选 CD。"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-erkao--zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602-q13","paper_id":"zj-26-erkao--zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602","source_question_id":"zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602-q13","number":"13","order":13,"type":"多选题","topics":["电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"8a857975d3b0cd2e59251abfedc368fea21482bd71a7ec5cac1d29632c9b6e9b","body":[{"type":"text","value":"13.如图所示的电路中， "},{"type":"math","value":"L _{1} , L _{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 是两个完全相同的小灯泡，分别与线圈L和电容器C串联后并接在P、Q两点间。两个小灯泡的额定电压都是1.5V，电阻随温度的变化可忽略不计，线圈L有较大的自感系数，其直流电阻可忽略不计，电容器C有较大的电容。电源E的电动势为1.5V，内阻可忽略不计，则\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/a833510a293e2d77726f56bbf4127ad234b7b686fe8ab1a6a0291d02c82a5b7b.png","width":371,"height":368,"width_mm":43.47,"row_group":"zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602-q13-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n\n原卷公共参数：可能用到的相关参数:重力加速度g取 "},{"type":"math","value":"1 0 \\mathrm { m } / \\mathrm { s } ^ { 2 }"},{"type":"text","value":"。\n第 13 题图\n"}],"choices":[[{"type":"text","value":"A. 开关S 闭合时， "},{"type":"math","value":"L _{1} , L _{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 同时亮"}],[{"type":"text","value":"B. 开关S闭合时，"},{"type":"math","value":"L_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"逐渐变亮， "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm { L } _ { 2 }"},{"type":"text","value":" 立即变亮后逐渐熄灭"}],[{"type":"text","value":"C. 电路稳定后断开 S， "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm { L _ { 1 } }"},{"type":"text","value":" 闪亮后逐渐熄灭"}],[{"type":"text","value":"D. 电路稳定后断开S瞬间，PQ间的电压为0"}]],"answer":{"status":"source","key":"BD","body":[{"type":"text","value":"解：开关 S 闭合时，线圈上的电流要从 0 开始逐渐增大，当电路稳定时，线圈上没有电压，小灯泡"},{"type":"math","value":"L_1"},{"type":"text","value":"正常发光。而电容器上原来不带电，会有一个充电过程，充电流逐渐减小为 0，所以"},{"type":"math","value":"L_1"},{"type":"text","value":"逐渐变亮，"},{"type":"math","value":"L_2"},{"type":"text","value":"立即变亮后逐渐熄灭，A 错 B 对。C．电路稳定后断开 S，线圈上的电流从原来值逐渐减小，所以"},{"type":"math","value":"L_1"},{"type":"text","value":"不会闪亮，C 错。电路稳定时，线圈 L 中的电流"},{"type":"math","value":"I=\\frac ER"},{"type":"text","value":"，电容器所在支路电流为 0，电容器两端电压为 E，断开 S 瞬间，线圈中的电流 I 保持不变，线圈 L 与电容器 C 及两个灯泡构成回路，电流方向为逆时针方向，所以电容器处于放电状态，两个小灯泡上的电流都是 I，所以小灯泡两端电压"},{"type":"math","value":"U=IR=1.5\\,\\mathrm V"},{"type":"text","value":"，可得 PQ 间的电压为 0，也可得线圈 L 的自感电动势为"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{\\text{自}}=U=1.5\\,\\mathrm V"},{"type":"text","value":"，D 正确。故选 BD。"}]}},{"id":"zj-26-erkao--zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602-q14","paper_id":"zj-26-erkao--zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602","source_question_id":"zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602-q14","number":"14","order":14,"type":"实验题","topics":["力学","电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"e5ecedda795ea4eaff48e135851d6142a65f7f96693b3de05e5c8187469f51eb","body":[{"type":"text","value":"14-I.（7分）在“探究平抛运动的特点”实验中\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/741621dbaab9132ac59bc33733847a878d02052c8788d62f2132f8a353471222.png","width":410,"height":478,"width_mm":48.09,"row_group":"zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602-q14-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 14-I 题图1\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/74d877afdfb0333cf9de2d078f51480022c5a93f2d6fa4e68d8d947422c364d2.png","width":411,"height":481,"width_mm":48.3,"row_group":"zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602-q14-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第14-I题图2\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/a9cff320a0498e112f2050234b04e931c5fe38eb0e0c57dcbceea7b36c9aa7bc.png","width":378,"height":445,"width_mm":44.31,"row_group":"zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602-q14-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 14-I 题图 3\n（1）用图1装置研究“平抛运动在竖直方向的运动规律”\n①下列说法正确的是"},{"type":"math","value":"\\underline{\\quad}"},{"type":"text","value":"\nA. A与B应选用大小相同的小球\nB. A与B应选用质量相同的小球\nC. 托板离地面的高度越大，两小球落地时间差也越大\nD. 减小铁锤打击金属片的力度，A球落地的时间会变短\n②实验时总是发现两小球不是同步落地，可能的原因是"},{"type":"math","value":"\\underline{\\quad}"},{"type":"text","value":"（多选）\nA. 托板未调水平\nB. 托板长度偏大\nC. 小铁锤打击金属片的力度偏大\nD. 小球与金属片之间的存在摩擦力\n（2）用图2装置重复实验，记录钢球经过的多个位置，拟合所得到的点迹，就可以得到平抛运动的轨迹。\n①某同学实验后发现在白纸上留下的点迹如图3所示，原因可能是 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\underline{\\quad}"},{"type":"text","value":"\nA. 斜槽有摩擦\nB. 实验小球的密度太小，受到阻力的影响较大\nC. 小球没有每次都从斜槽上同一个位置释放\n②经规范操作得到相应点迹后，某同学以槽口上边缘为原点O建立坐标系，得到轨迹曲线如图4。在曲线上取A、B两点，其坐标值分别为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{A} ( x _ { A } , y _ { A } )"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{B} ( x _ { B } , y _ { B } )"},{"type":"text","value":"\n（i）若测得 "},{"type":"math","value":"x _ { \\mathrm { B } } = 2 x _ { \\mathrm { A } }"},{"type":"text","value":" ，则 "},{"type":"math","value":"y_{ B }"},{"type":"math","value":"\\underline{\\quad}"},{"type":"math","value":"4y_{ A }"},{"type":"text","value":" （填“>”、“=”或“<”）；\n（ii）用图中B两点的坐标值计算水平抛出的初速度，其结果"},{"type":"math","value":"\\underline{\\quad}"},{"type":"text","value":"实际值（填“大于”、“等于”或“小于”）。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/d59cab7e65bf1bb903956bff16a744bde4133a2ef2f5447bcb3fed427dac91ad.png","width":551,"height":498,"width_mm":64.68,"row_group":"zhennan-qicai-jingcheng-jinlan-2602-q14-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 14-I题图4\n14-II.（7分）实验小组测量某一棒材的电阻率，测得其直径 "},{"type":"math","value":"d = 2.000 mm"},{"type":"text","value":" 、长 "},{"type":"math","value":"l = 40.00 cm"},{"type":"text","value":" 。实验室提供了如下器材:电流表（量程3mA，电阻 "},{"type":"math","value":"R _ { \\mathrm { A } }"},{"type":"text","value":" 约为3"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"），电压表（量程6V，电阻 "},{"type":"math","value":"R _ { \\mathrm { V } }"},{"type":"text","value":" 约为10k"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"），滑动变阻器（0\\~20"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"，额定电流1A），电源（6V，内阻约1"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":"），多用电表，开关一只，导线若干。\n（1）测量直径所用仪器是 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\underline{\\quad}"},{"type":"text","value":"\nA. 50分度的游标卡尺\nB. 螺旋测微器\nC. 毫米刻度尺\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/6fa490a88df7798c5bf07c2324da7abdaba